When $$n = 4$$,
$$R + r = r{\mathop{\rm cosec}
olimits} {\pi \over 4} \Rightarrow R + r = \sqrt 2 r \Rightarrow R = \left( {\sqrt 2 - 1} \right)r\therefore$$ Option (A) is wrong.
Option B :
When $$n = 5$$,
